BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:santorini-pyrgos-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-sotiros-pyrgos-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270805
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270807
SUMMARY:Panigiri of the Transfiguration (Sotiros)\, Pyrgos
LOCATION:Pyrgos\, Santorini\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Pyrgos keeps an old custom for the Transfiguration: on the eve the village boys 'steal' basil plants from the girls' courtyards to decorate the dome of the church of Christ\, and after the liturgy on 6 August there is a panigiri in the kastro lanes with wine\, food and music. One of the few Santorini feasts that still feels like a village affair.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/santorini/#pyrgos-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-sotiros-pyrgos
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/santorini/#pyrgos-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-sotiros-pyrgos
END:VEVENT
