BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:santorini-kamari-panigiri-of-panagia-myrtidiotissa-kamari-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270923
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270925
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Panagia Myrtidiotissa\, Kamari
LOCATION:Kamari\, Santorini\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Kamari's parish church of Panagia Myrtidiotissa celebrates on 24 September\, with vespers the evening before and a panigiri with wine\, food\, music and dancing for the beach village at the end of its season. Easy to reach by bus from Fira.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/santorini/#kamari-panigiri-of-panagia-myrtidiotissa-kamari
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/santorini/#kamari-panigiri-of-panagia-myrtidiotissa-kamari
END:VEVENT
